		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=17187#p17187"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>J&#039;ajoute qu&#039;un test de connexion à partir d&#039;un autre serveur (Linux), donne ceci : </p><p>red Thu May&#160; 2 11:49:21 2013 - postgres NOT ok Connections to cluster 8.3/servgipbd1:<br />&amp;red Error: DBI connect(&#039;dbname=postgres;host=servgipbd1;port=5432&#039;,&#039;hobbit&#039;,...) failed: server closed the connection unexpectedly<br />&#160; &#160; This probably means the server terminated abnormally<br />&#160; &#160; before or while processing the request. at /usr/lib/hobbit/client/bin/postgres_wm2 line 41</p>]]></content>
